      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING SCHRUB (1) is a handy type who notched his 14th career success when too good (22.68) from Box 6 at this track. Boasts a strong record from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Ideally placed to take this out. DASHING MIMCO (2) turned in a solid run last start over 400m at this track finishing 4th and beaten only 4 lengths (23.10). Returns to favourable track. Has ability and can measure up. JASPER DARKE (8) is generally an honest type in the frame at 32 of 70 starts but missed the placings last time when fourth (22.87) over 400m at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning 15 races. Rates a winning chance on best. LOCHINVAR GRACE (7) cannot be left out after placing last start.",
